1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 1]

34
00:01:43,510 --> 00:01:45,280
A cup of blood wine.

35
00:01:46,330 --> 00:01:48,560
The Late Emperor's Edict.

36
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:51,330
By Heaven's blessed mandate

37
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,950
and the grace of our forebears,

38
00:01:56,110 --> 00:01:59,080
our nation once faced grave peril.

39
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,920
Treacherous men sowed chaos

40
00:02:01,390 --> 00:02:02,740
and brought misery upon the people.

41
00:02:06,010 --> 00:02:07,030
In Yong, every young woman

42
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:09,190
[Flowering Rite]
who turns eighteen

43
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:10,020
[Coming-of-Age Ceremony
for Women of Yong]

44
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,910
[An important rite at eighteen]
is honored with a grand ceremony.

45
00:02:12,550 --> 00:02:13,630
Her hair is pinned and adorned
with flowers

46
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,210
to mark her coming of age.

47
00:02:16,550 --> 00:02:18,920
Today is my Flowering Rite.

48
00:02:19,890 --> 00:02:21,710
[Yun Shao, the Yuns' Second Daughter]
From today,

49
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,560
I may freely leave the mansion

50
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:25,780
and see the world outside.

51
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:39,010
[Yun Qi, the Yuns' Eldest Son]
Congratulations on your Flowering Rite.

52
00:02:39,020 --> 00:02:39,920
May you shine like the rising sun

53
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:41,200
and be renowned far and wide.

54
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:54,220
[Yun Heng, the Yuns' Eldest Daughter]

55
00:03:07,230 --> 00:03:07,960
You've worked hard, Yun Shao.

56
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,750
Thank you, Brother.

57
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:10,430
Father.

58
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,630
What's going on?

59
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:15,960
[Yun Zhanpeng, Minister of Yong]
I'm helping you complete the rite.

60
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,400
This is your duty

61
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,680
and your honor.

62
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:20,340
Mother.

63
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:21,940
Help me.

64
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,720
Be good.

65
00:03:24,070 --> 00:03:24,660
Yun Shao.

66
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:27,930
I'm wearing the pearl earrings
you gave me

67
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,240
to see you off.

68
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:33,940
A gift for you, Sister.

69
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,080
My lady.

70
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,540
My lady.

71
00:03:38,170 --> 00:03:38,830
My lady.

72
00:03:38,850 --> 00:03:40,620
[Yun Xiang, Yun Shao's Maid]
My lady.

73
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,560
Yun Xiang.

74
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,380
My lady.

75
00:03:42,770 --> 00:03:43,650
My lady.

76
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:44,170
Take her away.

77
00:03:44,170 --> 00:03:45,310
Remember what I gave you.

78
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,000
Yun Xiang.

79
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:46,600
Father.

80
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,080
One last hairpin

81
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:48,910
to end the Flowering Rite.

82
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,200
Where is she?

83
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:11,100
I'll go after her.

84
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:39,110
Yun Xiang.

85
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:44,360
Why is this happening?

86
00:04:46,530 --> 00:04:47,510
Congratulations

87
00:04:47,610 --> 00:04:48,480
on your Flowering Rite.

88
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,770
What would I have done

89
00:05:01,970 --> 00:05:03,160
without what you gave me?

90
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:06,860
Why do they want me dead?

91
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:22,100
[Tianxuan Blood Jade Mine]

92
00:05:33,660 --> 00:05:35,900
[Pei Zhao, Chief Commander
of the Fengyi Bureau]

93
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:38,460
[Ji Chang'an, Deputy Inspector
of the Fengyi Bureau]

94
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,940
[Xiao Ruoming, Deputy Inspector
of the Fengyi Bureau]

95
00:05:41,220 --> 00:05:43,420
[Lu Li, Commander of the Fengyi Bureau]

96
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,170
Stop.

97
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,870
This is the Blood Jade Mine.

98
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:27,120
Trespassers will be executed.

99
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,600
Seize them.

100
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:34,840
Fengyi Bureau.

101
00:06:35,170 --> 00:06:36,050
Lord Pei is here.

102
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,060
Stand aside.

103
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:38,440
Fengyi Bureau?

104
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:41,800
Without His Majesty's orders,

105
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,280
not even the Fengyi Bureau may enter.

106
00:06:43,750 --> 00:06:45,430
There was a tremor
in the mine yesterday.

107
00:06:46,020 --> 00:06:47,870
We're here on His Majesty's orders
to inspect it.

108
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:50,260
[Yong]

109
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:54,480
- Long live His Majesty.
- Long live His Majesty.

110
00:06:54,660 --> 00:06:54,960
Let's go.

111
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:17,820
[Young Pei Zhao]

112
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,750
Hurry.

113
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,040
Sir.

114
00:07:27,990 --> 00:07:29,510
[Miners' Register]
Many miners remain trapped below.

115
00:07:29,850 --> 00:07:30,440
Here are the names.

116
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,800
My lord,

117
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,240
this register cannot leave the mine.

118
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,870
It's evidence.

119
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,120
We have the right to inspect it.

120
00:07:37,730 --> 00:07:38,360
Yes.

121
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:40,510
Head into the mine.

122
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,750
Sir, you mustn't.

123
00:07:42,310 --> 00:07:43,630
There are always aftershocks.

124
00:07:43,830 --> 00:07:44,750
Going in now

125
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:45,630
is too dangerous.

126
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:47,360
If it was an earthquake,

127
00:07:47,910 --> 00:07:49,190
why only this mine?

128
00:07:50,590 --> 00:07:51,360
There's more to this.

129
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:41,660
[Yong]

130
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:44,600
Lord Zhu of the Astronomical Bureau

131
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,910
oversees the entire Flowering Rite.

132
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:49,470
Take this token and find him.

133
00:08:49,890 --> 00:08:50,230
Yes.

134
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:51,320
Who are you?

135
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,580
What are you doing here?

136
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:57,850
A miner.

137
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:05,480
Every miner has a mark on the arm.

138
00:09:05,810 --> 00:09:06,410
Where's yours?

139
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:07,970
I'm new.

140
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,270
Liar.

141
00:09:12,650 --> 00:09:14,000
A blood-jade hairpin.

142
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,150
All blood jade belongs to the Crown.

143
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:17,440
Possessing blood jade

144
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,550
is punishable by death.

145
00:09:18,670 --> 00:09:19,650
Tell me the truth.

146
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,270
It's not mine.

147
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:22,560
I found it.

148
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:24,320
Sir.

149
00:09:24,650 --> 00:09:25,720
What did you two find?

150
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:26,480
Sir,

151
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,840
we found this in the woods.

152
00:09:32,030 --> 00:09:34,150
Saltpeter and sulfur.

153
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,510
So there were explosives.

154
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:36,750
Let's head down.

155
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:37,330
Yes.

156
00:09:37,330 --> 00:09:40,220
[Fengyi Bureau]

157
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:49,740
Talk.

158
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,150
Where did you get the hairpin?

159
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:52,720
Three years ago,

160
00:09:53,410 --> 00:09:55,320
my husband, Xu, came to the capital
to seek help from relatives

161
00:09:55,810 --> 00:09:56,820
and found work here.

162
00:09:58,050 --> 00:09:58,910
I came looking for him,

163
00:09:59,450 --> 00:10:00,630
but he'd found another woman

164
00:10:01,510 --> 00:10:02,750
and tried to kill me.

165
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:04,790
That blood-jade hairpin

166
00:10:04,900 --> 00:10:06,010
is what he tried to kill me with.

167
00:10:11,330 --> 00:10:12,240
Whom did he turn to?

168
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:13,460
What kind of work did he find?

169
00:10:14,810 --> 00:10:15,470
I don't know.

170
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:16,620
You know nothing at all?

171
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,890
Then do you know

172
00:10:19,570 --> 00:10:21,030
the path you took today

173
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:21,930
leads to the Blood Jade Mine?

174
00:10:22,650 --> 00:10:24,030
Someone used that path

175
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,630
to bring explosives into the mine

176
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:26,700
and blow it up.

177
00:10:27,810 --> 00:10:28,260
My lord,

178
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:29,720
I was just passing through.

179
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,950
Confess now.

180
00:10:39,970 --> 00:10:40,600
How did it go?

181
00:10:40,870 --> 00:10:41,380
Did she talk?

182
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,000
Mostly lies,

183
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:46,390
but some of it was true.

184
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:48,420
Someone tried to kill her

185
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:49,280
with a blood-jade hairpin.

186
00:10:53,690 --> 00:10:54,510
Could it be

187
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:56,780
she knows who blew up the mine?

188
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:58,330
Someone wants her silenced.

189
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:05,680
Let her go.

190
00:11:06,730 --> 00:11:07,180
Let her go?

191
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:17,760
Understood.

192
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:34,900
[Fengyi Bureau]

193
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:42,760
I must find out why.

194
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:47,220
[Back Gate of Yun Mansion]

195
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,910
The master said

196
00:12:23,650 --> 00:12:26,690
a wicked servant should die
when yin and yang meet.

197
00:12:28,870 --> 00:12:30,440
The Netherworld won't take you.

198
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,670
The living world won't keep you.

199
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,720
You filthy girl, what are you doing?

200
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:42,180
Behave!

201
00:12:45,540 --> 00:12:47,050
This gesture is our signal.

202
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:49,550
Two shakes means leave.

203
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,290
Got a death wish?

204
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,800
You wretched maid. How dare you?

205
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:27,910
I can't let them see me.

206
00:13:31,060 --> 00:13:32,220
Come out, Yun Shao.

207
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,400
I saw you.

208
00:13:37,050 --> 00:13:37,650
Heng.

209
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,140
Yun Xiang is dead.

210
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:43,150
She's just a nobody.

211
00:13:44,150 --> 00:13:45,760
Why are you so worked up?

212
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,080
I meant to lure Yun Shao out with her.

213
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:49,120
Now that the bait is gone,

214
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,100
what do we do?

215
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,320
Let's go home first.

216
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:55,510
Father

217
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:56,710
is waiting for our report.

218
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:07,620
Yun Xiang, wait for me.

219
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,170
Yun Shao.

220
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:12,690
You won't get away this time.

221
00:14:36,290 --> 00:14:37,250
Young Master. A carriage.

222
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,940
I saw someone get in.

223
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:43,650
Who's in there?

224
00:14:43,970 --> 00:14:44,400
Come out.

225
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,040
Is your husband after you again?

226
00:14:57,140 --> 00:14:58,020
Fengyi Guards on official business.

227
00:14:58,420 --> 00:14:59,860
Clear the way, all of you.

228
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,110
Lord Pei.

229
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:04,260
I'm hunting down a wicked maid
who fled our household.

230
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,880
Have you seen her?

231
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:10,590
I'm going to kill them.

232
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:27,010
Young Master Yun,

233
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,560
throwing your weight around, I see.

234
00:15:29,810 --> 00:15:30,210
Chang'an.

235
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:31,060
Let's go.

236
00:15:31,670 --> 00:15:32,010
Yes.

237
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:45,870
Wingless scum. Why so arrogant?

238
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:52,960
Brother.

239
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:55,390
Watch your words and behavior.

240
00:15:55,570 --> 00:15:56,420
Keep a low profile.

241
00:15:57,230 --> 00:15:57,780
I know.

242
00:15:58,720 --> 00:15:59,690
This place reeks of bad luck.

243
00:15:59,690 --> 00:16:00,270
Let's get out of here.

244
00:16:02,250 --> 00:16:02,850
It's fine.

245
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,340
Just hurry

246
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:05,740
and send someone to check

247
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,870
why Pei Zhao came here

248
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,200
and who

249
00:16:10,210 --> 00:16:12,750
got into that carriage just now.

250
00:16:14,150 --> 00:16:14,660
Go find out now.

251
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:15,380
Yes.

252
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:27,100
You're a runaway maid of the Yun family?

253
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:29,710
I'm not.

254
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:34,910
Still not telling the truth?

255
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:43,490
With your nerve and skills,

256
00:16:44,170 --> 00:16:45,860
you dare go against the Yuns?

257
00:16:46,180 --> 00:16:46,740
What about you?

258
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,760
Do you dare investigate the Yuns?

259
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:50,930
They committed no crime.

260
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:52,200
Why would I investigate them?

261
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:56,460
Besides, the Fengyi Bureau can punish
even the imperial family

262
00:16:56,590 --> 00:16:58,340
and execute suspected rebels.

263
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,970
Nothing is beyond our reach.

264
00:17:09,830 --> 00:17:11,330
I only wish to serve you, My lord.

265
00:17:11,900 --> 00:17:14,130
Could you untie me?

266
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:24,000
You smell of psoralea and cinnamon.

267
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:26,870
Both are used for injuries from falls

268
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,080
and back pain.

269
00:17:29,370 --> 00:17:30,800
You've hurt your back?

270
00:17:34,490 --> 00:17:35,280
You know medicine?

271
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:37,470
No.

272
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:40,120
I just like making incense.

273
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:42,340
Some herbs can be used in blends.

274
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:44,820
So I know their scents.

275
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:51,400
Fine.

276
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:53,430
You've passed for now.

277
00:17:54,370 --> 00:17:55,570
Then use your nose

278
00:17:56,610 --> 00:17:58,360
to find what I'm looking for.

279
00:18:00,210 --> 00:18:00,720
Yes.

280
00:18:08,210 --> 00:18:08,590
Sir.

281
00:18:09,370 --> 00:18:10,550
Madam Xu's background is unknown.

282
00:18:11,230 --> 00:18:12,220
Are you going to keep her here?

283
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:14,380
She showed up suspiciously.

284
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:16,110
The physician just examined her.

285
00:18:16,500 --> 00:18:17,830
She has six wounds,

286
00:18:18,050 --> 00:18:19,250
all caused by blood jade.

287
00:18:19,810 --> 00:18:21,340
If she's just Yun Qi's mistress,

288
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:22,720
why torture her like this?

289
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:26,690
It is strange.

290
00:18:27,510 --> 00:18:28,790
Anyone who survives blood jade

291
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:29,620
is no ordinary woman.

292
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,410
She says she can use her sense of smell

293
00:18:31,420 --> 00:18:32,440
to help us find clues.

294
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:34,280
Let's keep her around and see.

295
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:51,830
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

296
00:18:53,450 --> 00:18:56,640
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

297
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,700
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

298
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:04,640
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

299
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:09,470
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

300
00:19:10,690 --> 00:19:15,700
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

301
00:19:16,020 --> 00:19:24,050
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

302
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:32,940
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

303
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:41,610
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

304
00:19:41,990 --> 00:19:50,860
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

305
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:59,780
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
